<noinclude>
==Template:Tobeadded==
This template creates a "To be added" placeholder with a plus icon, optionally linking to another page.

===Syntax===
Basic usage:
<pre>{{Tobeadded/simple}}</pre>
{{Tobeadded/simple}}

With internal wiki link:
<pre>{{Tobeadded/simple|wikilink=Matryoshka}}</pre>
{{Tobeadded/simple|wikilink=Matryoshka}}

With internal wiki link and action:
<pre>{{Tobeadded/simple|wikilink=Matryoshka|action=edit}}</pre>
{{Tobeadded/simple|wikilink=Matryoshka|action=edit}}

With external (interwiki) link:
<pre>{{Tobeadded|interwikilink=https://example.com}}</pre>
{{Tobeadded/simple|interwikilink=https://example.com}}

===Parameters===
* `wikilink` (optional) - Creates an internal wiki link to the specified page
* `action` (optional) - Adds a MediaWiki action parameter to the wikilink (e.g., edit, history, delete, raw)
* `interwikilink` (optional) - Creates an external link to the specified URL

===Common action values===
* edit - Opens the page in edit mode
* history - Shows the page history
* delete - Shows the deletion interface
* raw - Shows the raw wikitext
* protect - Shows the protection interface
* watch - Adds the page to your watchlist

===Notes===
When using the action parameter, the link will be rendered as an external link using the MediaWiki URL syntax. This is necessary to support action parameters properly.
</noinclude>